      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是小杏呢，什么也没想。\n既没想要奖励，也没想要认可……\n只是，想着要赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32b42fad71bd45978446e754002cbb450cb4ace7bbb257e0ff4e3f0a97c7d80f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
