    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dd2a19805e15b9f35c6b9f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我觉得啊……\n那样子看起来，格外的耀眼呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b1f5aa594b7a0039ffc79131aff1634c1812b7574333c82f3f4bbc441ac8780",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eab35ba277250195b8f4328f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（…………真耀眼啊）",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed093ddaaf74d047f37c7b72e3923d827c2ce16de64715b6bb3681480d18f20d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ddf293293d1deba37e45749",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "低声说完的房一潘多拉，\n像是被什么迷住了一样陷入了沉默。\n她的视线前方是――杏目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2216847eb73b81dec68fc98e7f34351abff7b3486aa36882936fcb6ed86380c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8da2cbb9c1f9a77db3702e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………杏、回来后开个会吧ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6377045ee9239e427e91ede87d472b51adbacde846ea5d0722c61691ae376da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:615a49ef6a42fa95bb2343c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………杏、回来后开个会吧ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6377045ee9239e427e91ede87d472b51adbacde846ea5d0722c61691ae376da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129114.json",
      "json_path": [
