    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:063e4dfa8ef38d9c9871cf1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她就是如此地耀眼。\n――甚至让人觉得，她不需要支援。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a20e6af93f23d9d6abd19379cc72f096bd134469cf503b22155ec26094f6110",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:200a7c07fff7f7b0be89f91a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使如此，她的训练员是我。\n那么我就要紧咬着不放，一直支持下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1695f96bc4a3267f3296f9ea07c6e95ecc62005e477ffd1efe81b2380cb5d25",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae0d9011fc537d5f6a4da9c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（绝对不能――输给自己！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "40bb872fd30f90d625d42d1cca47b9c46b73e0fb1d566d41c18d67726d8e8e60",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66efe6a7ef1b4cd2e06c8e57",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论多么著名的赛马娘，都有自己的训练员。\n总有一天，我一定要派上用场――",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2476ed59224b9dbfebe737c1a8b32be4a4bd6205fea92ccb7fefdba9493c006",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b45840a3ea6d316bb3c5b650",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（吁！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f4838710bab2d5eccf1a4c6ac47f877f3622e3a809b5f1619d36107f86d8b6c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
